[ceiling] These four square rail bearings retain the frame against vertical lift. They preserve the enclosure's production sliding profile. The native slice places one bed-rooted support beneath each bearing; each groove opens along its outer flank and its sliding entrance for support removal before assembly. The support contact locations are recorded in integration-review/frame-support-audit.json; physical removal and fit remain unqualified.
